  "releaseNotes": "Breaking changes: Update.Text, Update.File and User.Login are now nullable; message identifiers use long (ReplyMessageId, DeleteMessageRequest.MessageId); CreatePollRequest derives from SendRequest and MaxChoice is renamed to MaxChoices; CreateChatResponse and SendMessageResponse constructors changed. New: IBot (self/get, self/update); IMessages (typing, stickers, system messages, pin/unpin, reactions, sharing, file download); IChats chats/get, getChat, getMembers; polls getResults/getVoters with pagination cursor; suggest and action buttons, forwards, replies, threads, user_id and notification send options; rich update events (albums, stickers, membership changes, reactions, button requests). Fixed: default User-Agent (required by messages/getFile), multipart JSON field content types, polls query-string requests, empty-body typing response.",
